the final say (this is true even when you don't support change and extreme
cases where the partner choses to allow hirself to be dominated). Perhaps
you've misinterpreted my support of self-transformation to mean "support
for any change, regardless of consequence." If this is the case, you've
indeed missed the point of this extropian principle. Self-transformation is
not random mutation, but carefully considered improvement.

